  74           *      control register status. If busy bit of MIB control is set, that means MIB counter have been
  75           *      waiting for preparing, then software must wait atfer this busy flag reset by ASIC. This driver
  76           *      did not recycle reading user desired counter. Software must use driver again to get MIB counter
  77           *      if return value is not RT_ERR_OK.
